Apache Software Foundation. Apache, Apache Velocity and the Apache feather are trademarks of the Apache Software
Foundation. The ported behaviour, the template grammar and the test inputs taken from them remain under that licence;
`upstream/` and `upstream-tools/` pin the ported releases as submodules, with their own LICENSE and NOTICE files.

The expected outputs under tests/cases/ were recorded from the real Java libraries running with MockServer 8.0.0's
configuration (https://github.com/mock-server/mockserver, Apache-2.0).

The JDK semantics the crate builds on come from java-compat-rs (https://github.com/oxidestack/java-compat-rs,
Apache-2.0).
